== Features ==
[[Lonely Ävaeìkx]] is an [[NPC]] located in the '''Lonely Terrace'''. They ask the player to sit down in a chair for {{Green|3}} minutes in exchange for an [[#Enigma Souls|Enigma Soul]]. However, [[Lonely Ävaeìkx]] moves from table to table, and if they sit at the same table as the player, they must move to a different one in order to please [[Lonely Ävaeìkx|Ävaeìkx]]. Once the {{Green|3}} minutes are up, an [[Enigma Soul]] will be revealed in the center of the '''Lonely Terrace'''.

By the entrance to the '''Lonely Terrace''' is a hologram, detailing the player's highest time spent sitting with [[Lonely Ävaeìkx]], their ranking, and the total time spent by the [[SkyBlock]] community as a whole sitting in the '''Lonely Terrace'''.
